<title>USA: Hawaiian Airlines stake held by Cumberland.</title>
<headline>Hawaiian Airlines stake held by Cumberland.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cumberland Associates said on Friday that it held a 5.3 percent stake in Hawaiian Airlines Inc or 2,029,540 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the limited partnership said it bought the stake on September 20 at $3.25 per share.</p>
